अञ्चेश्छन्दस्यसर्वनामस्थाने — In the Vedas, case endings other than सर्वनामस्थान are accented after stems ending in अञ्च्.

इन्द्रा दधीची अस्थभिः (Ṛg I.84.13) — दधीच् had accent on धी by @ref[6.1.222], but the case affix अस् takes accent here.

@note[Though "instrumental and later" was already understood, असर्वनामस्थान is used to include शस् (accusative plural) as well: प्रतीचा बाहून् प्रतिभङ्व्येषाम्.]
